# Example .mailmap file for GitStats
# Maps different author identities to canonical names
#
# Format examples:
#   Proper Name <proper@email.com> Commit Name <commit@email.com>
#   Proper Name <proper@email.com> <commit@email.com>
#
# Note: When same email but different name, include both name and email on right side

# Map all Claude commits to one identity
Claude <claude@anthropic.com> Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

# Consolidate Dmitry/Dmitriy Novotochinov (typo in first name, same email)
Dmitry Novotochinov <trybeee@gmail.com> Dmitriy Novotochinov <trybeee@gmail.com>
